  "summary": "Activate the independent Small Shop answer-key boundary.",
  "why": "The operator approved private fixture-local logical JSON as independently hand-authored test evidence with no public compatibility contract and no compiler consumption. This transaction binds that exact decision, nine complete dependencies, strict input-oracle owner separation, and an empty three-scope worker boundary before any answer-key byte is authored."
